  details_id="more-information-paack"
  details={[
    "For almost all of my career I had worked mainly with Elixir and its ecosystem. I felt I needed to try other technologies, which is why I decided to move to Go.",
    "<strong>Paack is a startup focused on logistics</strong>. When I joined, the company was expanding its backend using Go. <strong>This experience allowed me to gain a deeper knowledge of SOLID principles, hexagonal architecture, and how to approach 24/7 systems without OTP.</strong>",
    "Together with a teammate, I designed and built the new routing platform from scratch. This microservice communicates with the external routing providers, offering a clear interface to internal microservices and hiding the complexity of each provider from the rest of the platform."
  ]}
